,"acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"இன்","tr":"iṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"று","tr":"ṟu"}]},{"text":"தந்தனை","tr":"tantaṉai","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தந்","tr":"tan"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தனை","tr":"taṉai"}]},{"text":"தேரோ","tr":"tērō","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தே","tr":"tē"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரோ","tr":"rō"}]}],[{"text":"நோயுழந்","tr":"nōyuḻan","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நோ","tr":"nō"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யுழந்","tr":"yuḻan"}]},{"text":"துறைவியை","tr":"tuṟaiviyai","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"துறை","tr":"tuṟai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வியை","tr":"viyai"}]},{"text":"நல்க","tr":"nalka","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நல்","tr":"nal"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"க","tr":"ka"}]},{"text":"லானே","tr":"lāṉē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"லா","tr":"lā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னே","tr":"ṉē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"சேயாறு","parts":[{"text":"சேய்","lemma":"cēy","gloss":"distant"},{"text":"ஆறு","lemma":"āṟu","gloss":"path"}],"gloss":"distant path"},{"surface":"செல்வாம்","parts":[{"text":"செல்வாம்","lemma":"செல்வாம்","gloss":"we will go"}],"gloss":"we will go","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ஆயின்","parts":[{"text":"ஆயின்","lemma":"āyiṉ","gloss":"if"}],"gloss":"if"},{"surface":"இடரின்று","parts":[{"text":"இடர்","lemma":"iṭar","gloss":"trouble"},{"text":"இன்று","lemma":"iṉṟu","gloss":"without"}],"gloss":"without trouble"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"களைகலம்","parts":[{"text":"களை","lemma":"kaḷai","gloss":"remove"},{"text":"கலம்","lemma":"kalam","gloss":"we will (suffix)"}],"gloss":"we will remove"},{"surface":"காமம்","parts":[{"text":"காமம்","lemma":"kāmam","gloss":"love-sickness"}],"gloss":"love-sickness"},{"surface":"பெருந்தோட்கு","parts":[{"text":"பெருந்தோட்கு","lemma":"பெருந்தோட்கு","gloss":"to her of large shoulders"}],"gloss":"to her of large shoulders","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"என்று","parts":[{"text":"என்று","lemma":"eṉṟu","gloss":"thinking thus"}],"gloss":"thinking thus"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நன்று","parts":[{"text":"நன்று","lemma":"naṉṟu","gloss":"goodness"}],"gloss":"goodness"},{"surface":"புரிந்து","parts":[{"text":"புரிந்து","lemma":"purintu","gloss":"desiring"}],"gloss":"desiring"},{"surface":"எண்ணிய","parts":[{"text":"எண்ணிய","lemma":"eṇṇiya","gloss":"thought"}],"gloss":"thought"},{"surface":"மனத்தையாகி","parts":[{"text":"மனத்தை","lemma":"maṉattai","gloss":"mind"},{"text":"ஆகி","lemma":"āki","gloss":"having become"}],"gloss":"having a mind"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"முரம்புகண்","parts":[{"text":"முரம்பு","lemma":"murampu","gloss":"gravelly ground"},{"text":"கண்","lemma":"kaṇ","gloss":"place"}],"gloss":"on the gravelly ground"},{"surface":"உடைய","parts":[{"text":"உடைய","lemma":"uṭaiya","gloss":"to break"}],"gloss":"to break"},{"surface":"ஏகி","parts":[{"text":"ஏகி","lemma":"ēki","gloss":"having gone"}],"gloss":"having gone"},{"surface":"கரம்பை","parts":[{"text":"கரம்பை","lemma":"karampai","gloss":"waste land"}],"gloss":"waste land"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"புதுவழி","parts":[{"text":"புது","lemma":"putu","gloss":"new"},{"text":"வழி","lemma":"vaḻi","gloss":"path"}],"gloss":"new path"},{"surface":"படுத்த","parts":[{"text":"படுத்த","lemma":"paṭutta","gloss":"made"}],"gloss":"made"},{"surface":"மதியுடை","parts":[{"text":"மதி","lemma":"mati","gloss":"intellect"},{"text":"உடை","lemma":"uṭai","gloss":"possessing"}],"gloss":"wise"},{"surface":"வல்லோய்","parts":[{"text":"வல்லோய்","lemma":"vallōy","gloss":"O capable one"}],"gloss":"O capable one"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இன்று","parts":[{"text":"இன்று","lemma":"iṉṟu","gloss":"today"}],"gloss":"today"},{"surface":"தந்தனை","parts":[{"text":"தந்தனை","lemma":"tantaṉai","gloss":"you brought"}],"gloss":"you brought"},{"surface":"தேரோ","parts":[{"text":"தேர்","lemma":"tēr","gloss":"chariot"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ō","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"the chariot"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நோயுழந்து","parts":[{"text":"நோய்","lemma":"nōy","gloss":"pain of separation"},{"text":"உழந்து","lemma":"uḻantu","gloss":"suffering"}],"gloss":"suffering pain"},{"surface":"உறைவியை","parts":[{"text":"உறைவி","lemma":"uṟaivi","gloss":"she who resides"},{"text":"ஐ","lemma":"ai","gloss":"accusative"}],"gloss":"her who resides"},{"surface":"நல்கலானே","parts":[{"text":"நல்கலான்","lemma":"nalkalāṉ","gloss":"by granting grace"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"by granting grace"}]}],"literal":"If we go on the distant path, without trouble / we will remove the love-sickness of her with large shoulders, thinking thus, / having a mind that thought and desired goodness, / going so as to break the gravelly ground, on the waste land / O wise capable one who made a new path! / Today you brought the chariot, / by granting grace to her who resides suffering pain.","translation":"O wise and capable charioteer, with a mind set on doing good, you thought, 'If we travel this long path without any hindrance, we can dispel the love-sickness of her with beautiful, large shoulders!' Driving the chariot so fast that it broke through the gravelly ground of the wasteland to carve out a new path, you brought me here today, bestowing grace upon my wife who was languishing in the pain of separation.","modern":"நெடுந்தொலைவுப் பாதையில் நாம் இடையூறு இல்லாமல் சென்றால், பெரிய தோள்களைக் கொண்ட தலைவியின் காம நோயைத் தீர்க்கலாம் என்று நன்மையை நாடி எண்ணிய மனத்தை உடையவனாய், முரம்பு நிலத்தின் கற்கள் உடையுமாறு செலுத்தி, கரம்பை நிலத்தில் புதிய வழியை உண்டாக்கிய அறிவுடைய பாகனே! துன்பத்தில் வருந்தி வாழும் தலைவிக்கு அருள் செய்யும் பொருட்டு, இன்று நீ தேரை விரைந்து செலுத்தி என்னைக் கொண்டு வந்து சேர்த்தாய்.","explanation":"This poem is spoken by the hero to his charioteer upon returning home. The hero praises the charioteer's empathy and exceptional skill in driving. The charioteer shared the hero's eagerness to relieve the heroine's suffering and drove the chariot with such speed that it broke through rough, gravelly wasteland to carve out a new path. This setting belongs to the Mullai tiṇai, which represents the patient waiting of the heroine and the swift return of the hero. Key words like 'மதியுடை வல்லோய்' (wise, capable one) and 'புதுவழி' (new path) highlight the charioteer's dedication to bringing the lovers together.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}